ja 1ª","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wpw0QjiM1JhTVA7YlgBXOhQ30q6.jpg"},{"id":1008406,"name":"Alicia Altabella","role":"Monja 2ª","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x0qSvt8KBEictUA0QwsthmCl2xL.jpg"},{"id":37521,"name":"Carmen Giralt","role":"Monja A"},{"id":237481,"name":"Carmen Luján","role":"Monja B"},{"id":3226986,"name":"Lola Mateo","role":"Sor A"},{"id":2317044,"name":"Casimira Encinas","role":"Sor B"},{"id":1125748,"name":"Alicia González","role":"Sor X"},{"id":2015215,"name":"Carmen Santonja","role":"Sor Y"},{"id":34792,"name":"Miguel Molina","role":"Tarzán","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x2nmTfsnLGYRkpRDWH2O9JPyozG.jpg"},{"id":54145,"name":"Flavia Zarzo","role":"Novicia","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g8CFYonhRK8NAa18EesbVx4ecwS.jpg"},{"id":309,"name":"Pedro Almodóvar","role":"Passagier in Bus (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dKlaXJk3NLcsC1CKMx6xmyW5BZD.jpg"},{"id":952,"name":"Agustín Almodóvar","role":"Briefträger (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ciY5icxyNekGwD3taLvzOprp2w5.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"L'indiscreto fascino del peccato","overview":"Dopo la morte per overdose del fidanzato, una cantante di flamenco trova accoglienza nel piccolo convento madrileno delle “redentrici umiliate”, popolato da una variegata comunità di suore traviate, lesbiche, masochiste ed eroinomani che scrivono romanzi erotici sotto falso nome e viaggiano come corrieri della droga."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Dark Habits","overview":"After her drug pusher boyfriend overdoses on heroin, a cabaret singer finds refuge from the authorities in a convent for fallen women."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Yolanda Bell, una cantante de boleros, adicta a las drogas, temeraria y ambigua, ve morir a su novio por una sobredosis de heroína adulterada. Asustada, decide recluirse en un convento de la orden de las ”Redentoras Humilladas”. Una orden muy peculiar cuya Madre Superiora es una gran admiradora de Yolanda. Desde hace muchos años, las ”Redentoras Humilladas” intentan salvar del pecado a las chicas de vida descarriada, aunque, últimamente, el convento pasa por una crisis. Yolanda es muy bien recibida, especialmente por la Madre Superiora, que suele convertirse en cómplice drogadicta y amiga de todas las chicas que pasan por el convento. Así pues, las dos compartirán la droga conseguida por Yolanda, que se convertirá en la favorita de la Madre Superiora. Pero, cuando aparece Merche, ex amante de la Madre Superiora, huyendo de la policía, surgen problemas.","tagline":"Una Película de Pedro Almodóvar"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pkdAdszI2u8QvpgjXp910mQx0I4.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/njHtlpln6iBMonTkXGI7plRMaIM.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":8220,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pkdAdszI2u8QvpgjXp910mQx0I4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pkdAdszI2u8QvpgjXp910mQx0I4.jpg","language":"it","width":726,"height":1090},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pkdAdszI2u8QvpgjXp910mQx0I4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pkdAdszI2u8QvpgjXp910mQx0I4.jpg","language":"it","width":726,"height":1090},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u90XG6ePgBZGS1e6E0jO5IsHhui.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u90XG6ePgBZGS1e6E0jO5IsHhui.jpg","language":"it","width":960,"height":1440}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AB9cm20W0lGebbI39swUmdYZAV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AB9cm20W0lGebbI39swUmdYZA